<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Nishat Mills 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Nishat Mills 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31, 1997 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales	     3,824 vs 3,408</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit    182 vs    32</p>
<p>    After-tax profit  157 vs    44</p>
<p>    Interim dividend  nil vs   nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Nishat Mills Ltd is Pakistan's biggest textile mill and is located in Faisalabad. No book closure as no dividend announced. The company carried forward 157 million rupees vs 78 million to the balance sheet.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
